                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n\nA[START] --&gt; B{User Action?}\n\nB --&gt;|Register| R1[Register API Called]\nB --&gt;|Login| L1[Login API Called]\nB --&gt;|Verify Email| V1[VerifyEmail API Called]\nB --&gt;|Resend OTP| RS1[ResendOTP API Called]\nB --&gt;|Forgot Password| F1[ForgotPassword API Called]\nB --&gt;|Reset Password| RP1[ResetPassword API Called]\nB --&gt;|Logout| O1[Logout API Called]\n\n%% ================= REGISTER FLOW =================\nR1 --&gt; R2{All fields present?}\nR2 --&gt;|No| R3[400: All fields required] --&gt; END1[END]\nR2 --&gt;|Yes| R4[Check email/mobile exists]\nR4 --&gt; R5{Already exists?}\nR5 --&gt;|Yes| R6[409: Email/Mobile already registered] --&gt; END2[END]\nR5 --&gt;|No| R7[Begin DB Transaction]\nR7 --&gt; R8[Hash Password bcrypt]\nR8 --&gt; R9[Generate OTP + Expiry 5min]\nR9 --&gt; R10[Insert User into DB]\nR10 --&gt; R11[Send OTP Email]\nR11 --&gt; R12[Commit Transaction]\nR12 --&gt; R13[201: Registered + OTP sent] --&gt; END3[END]\n\n%% ================= LOGIN FLOW =================\nL1 --&gt; L2{Email &amp; Password present?}\nL2 --&gt;|No| L3[400: Email &amp; password required] --&gt; END4[END]\nL2 --&gt;|Yes| L4[Find user by email]\nL4 --&gt; L5{User exists?}\nL5 --&gt;|No| L6[401: Invalid email/password] --&gt; END5[END]\nL5 --&gt;|Yes| L7{Email verified?}\nL7 --&gt;|No| L8[403: Verify email first] --&gt; END6[END]\nL7 --&gt;|Yes| L9[Compare password bcrypt]\nL9 --&gt; L10{Password correct?}\nL10 --&gt;|No| L11[401: Invalid email/password] --&gt; END7[END]\nL10 --&gt;|Yes| L12[Generate JWT Token]\nL12 --&gt; L13[Store token in httpOnly Cookie]\nL13 --&gt; L14[200: Login success + user data] --&gt; END8[END]\n\n%% ================= VERIFY EMAIL FLOW =================\nV1 --&gt; V2{Email &amp; OTP present?}\nV2 --&gt;|No| V3[400: Email &amp; OTP required] --&gt; END9[END]\nV2 --&gt;|Yes| V4[Get user by email]\nV4 --&gt; V5{User exists?}\nV5 --&gt;|No| V6[404: